        {
          "text": " Kandi Yoshua yaahandiika ebigambo ebyo omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Ruhanga; yaatwara eibaare rihango, yaaribyara ahansi y'omwela, ogwabaire guri haihi n'Omwanya gwa MUKAMA ogurikwera. ",
