        },
        {
          "text": " Amagufa ga Yosefu, agu Abaisraeli baihire Misri, baagaziika Shekemu omu kibanja eki Yakobo yaaguzire ahari beene Hamori ishe wa Shekemu ebicweka igana by'efeeza; ekibanja ekyo kyaba obuhunguzi bwa baijukuru ba Yosefu. ",
